  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\ntan θ = 7/24\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\n(cos2 θ - sin2 θ) = cos(2θ)\n\ncos(2θ) = (1 - tan²θ) / (1 + tan²θ)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\ntanθ = 7/24\n\ntan²θ = (7/24)²\n\ntan²θ = 49/576\n\ncos(2θ) = (1 - 49/576) / (1 + 49/576)\n\ncos(2θ) = (576/576 - 49/576) / (576/576 + 49/576)\n\ncos(2θ) = (527/576) / (625/576)\n\ncos(2θ) = 527/625\n\n**The value of (cos2 θ - sin2 θ)**** is 527/625.**",
